# Capability matrix

Canonical product plan: [`docs/00-product/capability-matrix.md`](docs/00-product/capability-matrix.md) (adopted 2026-08-14).

- **🟢 Existing** — shipped; do not rebuild.
- **🟡 Hardening** — prefer this over new surfaces.
- **🔵 Planned** — in initial scope; do not implement until an authorized slice.
- **⚪ Later** / **🔴 Frozen / out of scope** — closed. Terminals, payment gateway, online payment, multi-location, payroll, aggregators, AI stay frozen.

Do not invent Phase 4.16 from this matrix. Code evidence remains `docs/00-product/feature-list.md`. If a Planned row already has a shipped slice (86, cash drawer, SKU wastage, valuation, addon groups), deepen it — do not start over.

Recipe/BOM (R5) and procurement (R6) are Existing — deepen only with authorization. Do not treat them as Planned rebuilds.
